      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ELECTRIC KUNA (5) used the inside draw to advantage last time and hit the ground running with a sensational early split, but could manage only the minor money when a 0.8 lengths second at Cannington over 381m in 22.08. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Can measure up this time. FASHION SQUARE (1) boasts a strong record this journey here with two wins and two minors from five tries. Missed the frame latest (17.60) when seventh over 300m at this track in a Grade 4. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. TURBO TATE (7) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 5.5 lengths at this track in a handy 22.47 beating Maximum Hughes. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Will go close again if runs up to latest. MR FLAME (2) has top-three aspirations after placing here over this journey last time.",
